# ============================================================================
# AMLBotDS .gitignore FLOOR  (safe, additive — see ClaudeShared/rules/no-dotfiles-in-git.md)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Installer applies this body ADDITIVELY to any nested repo that lacks the floor.
# It prepends/merges these lines; it does NOT remove a repo's existing rules.
# Already-tracked files are NOT protected by .gitignore — untrack them with
#   git rm --cached <file>   (see s6-secrets.md runbook §C).
# This floor is PREVENTION only. It does NOT rotate keys or rewrite history.
# Provenance: rule imported from coordinator; minted by the AMLBotDS 2026-05-28
#   tracer-internal-api incident. (AMLBotDS has run no retros of its own.)
# ============================================================================

# Dotfiles are NEVER committed (secrets / local config live outside git).
# Only .gitignore itself is tracked. .* matches EVERY dotfile by default;
# add a narrow !-exception per EXACT file only if CI needs it AND it has no secret.
.*
!.gitignore

# Local secrets / agent / editor / machine config — never commit.
# (*.example / *.sample templates ARE meant to be committed, so they are re-included)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example
!.env.sample
!.env.*.sample
.envrc
.mcp.json
.mcp.*.json
.npmrc
.amlbot.dev.api
.claude/
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
.coverage
.dagster_home/

# Claude agent working dirs — gitignored per peppermint-task-{planning,completion}.md
plans/
workdone/

# Build / deps / local artifacts
node_modules/
dist/
cache/
*.log


